		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_gate_st_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>◇サザナミわんで　おおむかしの　かいていいせきが　みつかりました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-23T02:35:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-27T02:52:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>◇サザナミわんで　大昔の　海底遺跡が　みつかりました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-23T02:35:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
